Sadaf VPN is not directed to children under the age of 13.

We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If we become aware that we have collected personal information from a child under 13 without appropriate authorization, we will take steps to delete that information.

If you are a parent or guardian and believe a child has provided us with personal information, please contact us using the email address below.

